{
 "sheet": 1,
 "name": "74LVC1G3208MDBVTEP",
 "kind": "logic",
 "manufacturer": "Texas Instruments",
 "title": "Single 3-input OR-AND gate, 1.65 V to 5.5 V, enhanced product, -55 °C to 125 °C",
 "source": {
  "revision": "SCES846A, revised February 2013",
  "pages": 16
 },
 "summary": "The SN74LVC1G3208-EP is one LVC-family gate computing Y = (A + B) · C from a 1.65 V to 5.5 V supply. Grounding A or B turns it into a 2-input AND gate, and tying C to VCC turns it into a 2-input OR gate. Its inputs carry hysteresis (250 mV typ at 3.3 V) and accept up to 5.5 V at any supply, Ioff protects it when unpowered, and the output drives ±24 mA at 3 V. This enhanced-product version is rated -55 °C to 125 °C in a 6-pin SOT-23 (DBV).",
 "key_figures": [
  [
   "Function",
